{"content":[{"c":["ZICHRI*, ZICRI"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Kohathite Levite and a descendant of Izhar (",{"href":"?bref=Exod.6.21","r":"Exod.6.21","rawR":"Exod.6.21","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Exod.6.21","value":"Exod.6.21"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ex 6:21"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. One of Shimei’s sons from Benjamin’s tribe (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.8.19","r":"1Chr.8.19","rawR":"1Chr.8.19","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.8.19","value":"1Chr.8.19"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 8:19"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. One of Shashak’s sons from Benjamin’s tribe (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.8.23","r":"1Chr.8.23","rawR":"1Chr.8.23","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.8.23","value":"1Chr.8.23"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 8:23"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["4. One of Jeroham’s sons from Benjamin’s tribe (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.8.27","r":"1Chr.8.27","rawR":"1Chr.8.27","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.8.27","value":"1Chr.8.27"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 8:27"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["5. Ancestor of Mattaniah. Mattaniah returned with Zerubbabel to Israel following the exile (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.9.15","r":"1Chr.9.15","rawR":"1Chr.9.15","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.9.15","value":"1Chr.9.15"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 9:15"},"); Zicri is probably identifiable with Zabdi in ",{"href":"?bref=Neh.11.17","r":"Neh.11.17","rawR":"Neh.11.17","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.11.17","value":"Neh.11.17"}],"t":"ref","v":"Nehemiah 11:17"},"."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["6. Descendant of Eliezer, the son of Moses. His son, Shelomoth, was in charge of the treasuries of the dedicated gifts (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.26.25","r":"1Chr.26.25","rawR":"1Chr.26.25","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.26.25","value":"1Chr.26.25"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 26:25"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["7. Father of Eliezer, the chief officer of the Reubenites during David’s reign (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.27.16","r":"1Chr.27.16","rawR":"1Chr.27.16","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.27.16","value":"1Chr.27.16"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 27:16"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["8. Father of Amasiah, a volunteer in charge of 200,000 men during Jehoshaphat’s reign (",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.17.16","r":"2Chr.17.16","rawR":"2Chr.17.16","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.17.16","value":"2Chr.17.16"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Chr 17:16"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["9. Father of Elishaphat, a participant in the conspiracy against Athaliah led by Jehoiada (",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.23.1","r":"2Chr.23.1","rawR":"2Chr.23.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.23.1","value":"2Chr.23.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Chr 23:1"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["10. Mighty man of Ephraim who participated in Pekah’s subjugation of Judah. Zicri killed Ahaz’s son Maaseiah, Azrikam the commander of the palace, and Elkanah the king’s deputy (",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.28.7","r":"2Chr.28.7","rawR":"2Chr.28.7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.28.7","value":"2Chr.28.7"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Chr 28:7"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["11. Father of Joel, overseer of the Benjaminites who returned to Jerusalem following the exile (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.11.9","r":"Neh.11.9","rawR":"Neh.11.9","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.11.9","value":"Neh.11.9"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 11:9"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["12. Levite who served as a priest and the head of the clan of Abijah during the days of Joiakim the high priest (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.12.17","r":"Neh.12.17","rawR":"Neh.12.17","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.12.17","value":"Neh.12.17"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 12:17"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"ZichriZicri","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Ex 6:21","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Exod.6.21","rawQueryValue":"Exod.6.21","sourceRefExact":"Exod.6.21"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 8:19","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.8.19","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.8.19","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.8.19"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 8:23","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.8.23","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.8.23","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.8.23"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 8:27","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.8.27","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.8.27","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.8.27"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 9:15","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.9.15","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.9.15","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.9.15"},{"anchorText":"Nehemiah 11:17","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.11.17","rawQueryValue":"Neh.11.17","sourceRefExact":"Neh.11.17"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 26:25","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.26.25","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.26.25","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.26.25"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 27:16","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.27.16","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.27.16","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.27.16"},{"anchorText":"2 Chr 17:16","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Chr.17.16","rawQueryValue":"2Chr.17.16","sourceRefExact":"2Chr.17.16"},{"anchorText":"2 Chr 23:1","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Chr.23.1","rawQueryValue":"2Chr.23.1","sourceRefExact":"2Chr.23.1"},{"anchorText":"2 Chr 28:7","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Chr.28.7","rawQueryValue":"2Chr.28.7","sourceRefExact":"2Chr.28.7"},{"anchorText":"Neh 11:9","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.11.9","rawQueryValue":"Neh.11.9","sourceRefExact":"Neh.11.9"},{"anchorText":"Neh 12:17","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.12.17","rawQueryValue":"Neh.12.17","sourceRefExact":"Neh.12.17"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"700497fb25110d70d25789fbc610aa41899d44ce9d75e8af08edf3971667c72c","sourceItemName":"ZichriZicri","sourceItemOrder":107,"sourceMember":"Articles/Z.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"ZichriZicri","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Zichri*, Zicri","title":"Zichri*, Zicri","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}